# SOLO-004 raw per-hand datasets: full JSONL is 100k+ rows and routinely exceeds GitHub's 100MB
# file limit uncompressed (~600MB observed) - only the gzip-compressed version (~15MB, ~40x
# smaller thanks to the repeated key names) is committed. The raw file is fully regeneratable via
# run_solo004_dataset.py with the same --seed, so nothing is lost by not tracking it directly.
results/solo_baseline/*.jsonl
